  tutorialManager: {fileID: 354848722}
  Text: These are usable items you can find These On Alters like these, there are
    two types of items Throwables and usables. Throwables will Always be held in
    the Right Hand Hold Q to charge how hard you want to throw, and usables are always
    in left hand press or hold R to use the item. to discard left item Hold Q and
    Left click at the same time.
